# v2.15.10: docs/taskgroup-user-manual.md was a raw claude jsonl
# transcript (not a rendered manual) — every line carried cwd, sessionId,
# agentId, model refs. Removed to protect the public-repo attack surface.
# Ignore the exact path + any future *-user-manual.md files so a debug
# dump can't sneak back into docs/.
docs/taskgroup-user-manual.md
docs/**/*-user-manual.md

# Test artifacts — never commit, regenerated on every test run
# (note: a handful of legacy files are still tracked from before this
# rule existed; the ignore here only stops NEW ones from accumulating.)
.claude/agents/hive-agent-*.md
test-multi-agent-report/screenshots/
test-results/
playwright-report/
/index.js
